chival records, question the residents, analyze disappearance locations, and deduce the entity's behavioral patterns on your own. Your tactical advantage during the inevitable direct contact depends heavily on the quality of the information gathered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780310/extras/b0a24a3d0baa76f8cff4434d56bf3807.poster.avif?t=1781280147\" width=780 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780310/extras/b0a24a3d0baa76f8cff4434d56bf3807.webm?t=1781280147\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780310/extras/b0a24a3d0baa76f8cff4434d56bf3807.mp4?t=1781280147\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "PSX-style survival horror set in a post-Soviet SCP universe. As a Foundation Agent, investigate rumors of missing people's voices. Evade SCP-939 - a blind predator tracking sound and mimicking human speech. Gather intel to call the MTF, and choose between strict orders and saving locals.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780310/aef97238a0bc98f8db4e17cdde25b2bf1d4ff427/header.jpg?t=1781280147", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780310/3f3dab3eefe38302e9ba4ec9b4c38049a356a20a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781280147", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4780310/3f3dab3eefe38302e9ba4ec9b4c38049a356a20a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17